{"book":19,"chapter":10,"rubric":"СЕТЬ LINUX / ГЛАВА 10","slides":[{"title":"Мост — коммутатор в ядре","sub":"Глава 10 · Сеть Linux","short":"Мост","main":"Программный коммутатор второго уровня: порты, мак-адреса, свой интерфейс.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Ядро","Порты","br0","Уровень 2"],"captions":["Мост — программный коммутатор внутри ядра","Порт: карта, конец veth или tap виртуальной машины","Сам мост виден как интерфейс br0, на нём адрес хоста","Решает по мак-адресу получателя, IP не знает"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"программный коммутатор в ядре","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"программный коммутатор в ядре","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"порты: eth, veth, tap","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"программный коммутатор в ядре","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"порты: eth, veth, tap","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"br0: интерфейс и адрес хоста","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"программный коммутатор в ядре","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"порты: eth, veth, tap","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"br0: интерфейс и адрес хоста","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"решает по MAC, не по IP","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[8.3,18.3,28.8]}]},{"title":"Создать мост и добавить порт","sub":"Глава 10 · Сеть Linux","short":"Команды","main":"ip link add type bridge, set master, nomaster; адрес на мосту.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Создать","Порт","Проверка","Убрать"],"captions":["Добавляем устройство типа bridge и поднимаем его","set master делает eth1 портом, адрес хоста ставим на br0","bridge link show перечисляет порты и их состояния","nomaster возвращает интерфейс из моста; brctl устарел"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add name br0 type bridge","$ ip link set br0 up","$ ip link set eth1 master br0","$ ip addr add 192.168.1.10/24 dev br0","$ bridge link show","3: eth1: <...> master br0 state forwarding","$ ip link set eth1 nomaster"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add name br0 type bridge","$ ip link set br0 up","$ ip link set eth1 master br0","$ ip addr add 192.168.1.10/24 dev br0","$ bridge link show","3: eth1: <...> master br0 state forwarding","$ ip link set eth1 nomaster"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add name br0 type bridge","$ ip link set br0 up","$ ip link set eth1 master br0","$ ip addr add 192.168.1.10/24 dev br0","$ bridge link show","3: eth1: <...> master br0 state forwarding","$ ip link set eth1 nomaster"],"hl":[4,5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add name br0 type bridge","$ ip link set br0 up","$ ip link set eth1 master br0","$ ip addr add 192.168.1.10/24 dev br0","$ bridge link show","3: eth1: <...> master br0 state forwarding","$ ip link set eth1 nomaster"],"hl":[6],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[8.9,19.2,28.3]}]},{"title":"veth — виртуальный кабель","sub":"Глава 10 · Сеть Linux","short":"veth","main":"Пара устройств: кадр из одного конца выходит из другого.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Пара","Концы","Список","Напарник"],"captions":["Устройство создаётся только парой, при создании называем оба конца","Оба конца поднимаем; один подключаем к мосту (или в netns)","В списке интерфейсов видно veth0@veth1 и veth1@veth0","ethtool -S показывает peer_ifindex, по нему находим дальний конец"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add veth0 type veth peer name veth1","$ ip link set veth0 up","$ ip link set veth1 master br0 up","$ ip -br link show type veth","veth0@veth1  UP  5a:8c:d4:1e:11:90","veth1@veth0  UP  8e:3c:01:7a:22:b4","$ ethtool -S veth0","  peer_ifindex: 8"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add veth0 type veth peer name veth1","$ ip link set veth0 up","$ ip link set veth1 master br0 up","$ ip -br link show type veth","veth0@veth1  UP  5a:8c:d4:1e:11:90","veth1@veth0  UP  8e:3c:01:7a:22:b4","$ ethtool -S veth0","  peer_ifindex: 8"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add veth0 type veth peer name veth1","$ ip link set veth0 up","$ ip link set veth1 master br0 up","$ ip -br link show type veth","veth0@veth1  UP  5a:8c:d4:1e:11:90","veth1@veth0  UP  8e:3c:01:7a:22:b4","$ ethtool -S veth0","  peer_ifindex: 8"],"hl":[3,4,5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip link add veth0 type veth peer name veth1","$ ip link set veth0 up","$ ip link set veth1 master br0 up","$ ip -br link show type veth","veth0@veth1  UP  5a:8c:d4:1e:11:90","veth1@veth0  UP  8e:3c:01:7a:22:b4","$ ethtool -S veth0","  peer_ifindex: 8"],"hl":[6,7],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[11.4,21.5,30.5]}]},{"title":"Читаем ip -d link","sub":"Глава 10 · Сеть Linux","short":"ip -d","main":"Времена в сотых долях секунды, STP, VLAN-фильтрация, bridge_id.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Времена","STP и VLAN","bridge_id","Порт"],"captions":["Времена в сотых долях секунды: ageing_time 30000 это 300 с","stp_state 0: STP выключен; priority 32768; vlan_filtering 0","bridge_id: приоритет и MAC (по умолчанию наименьший MAC порта)","У порта: bridge_slave, state, priority 32, cost, learning, flood"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip -d link show br0","bridge forward_delay 1500 hello_time 200","  max_age 2000 ageing_time 30000","  stp_state 0 priority 32768","  vlan_filtering 0 vlan_protocol 802.1Q","  bridge_id 8000.525400aabbcc","$ ip -d link show veth1","bridge_slave state forwarding priority 32","  cost 2 hairpin off learning on flood on"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip -d link show br0","bridge forward_delay 1500 hello_time 200","  max_age 2000 ageing_time 30000","  stp_state 0 priority 32768","  vlan_filtering 0 vlan_protocol 802.1Q","  bridge_id 8000.525400aabbcc","$ ip -d link show veth1","bridge_slave state forwarding priority 32","  cost 2 hairpin off learning on flood on"],"hl":[3,4],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip -d link show br0","bridge forward_delay 1500 hello_time 200","  max_age 2000 ageing_time 30000","  stp_state 0 priority 32768","  vlan_filtering 0 vlan_protocol 802.1Q","  bridge_id 8000.525400aabbcc","$ ip -d link show veth1","bridge_slave state forwarding priority 32","  cost 2 hairpin off learning on flood on"],"hl":[5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip -d link show br0","bridge forward_delay 1500 hello_time 200","  max_age 2000 ageing_time 30000","  stp_state 0 priority 32768","  vlan_filtering 0 vlan_protocol 802.1Q","  bridge_id 8000.525400aabbcc","$ ip -d link show veth1","bridge_slave state forwarding priority 32","  cost 2 hairpin off learning on flood on"],"hl":[6,7,8],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[9.2,18.6,28.5]}]},{